WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.063
An ablation removes components one at a time: the
Current State, Past State,

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:07.093
video stream, behavior stream,

00:00:07.173 --> 00:00:11.356
and contrastive objective each add measurable
predictive power.

00:00:11.436 --> 00:00:12.913
Two findings stand out.

00:00:12.993 --> 00:00:17.582
Jointly training on neural responses and behavior
beats either alone,

00:00:17.662 --> 00:00:21.710
and the contrastive objective helps most when data
is scarce.
